            </ol>
            <p class="aside">In Chat mode, ChatGPT does not use Archie and may answer from the web. To call Archie directly in Work mode, type <b>/</b> and choose <b>Rotary Archie</b> under Skills. On ChatGPT Free, choose ChatGPT Free above.</p>
            <div class="dl"><a class="btn fill sq" href={DOWNLOAD}><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-down"/></svg>Download rotary-archie.zip</a><small>Always the newest version.</small></div>
            <p class="more"><a href={u('get/chatgpt/')}>Full ChatGPT guide</a></p>
          </section>
          <div class="choice"><input type="radio" name="assistant" id="c-work" value="work" aria-controls="p-work" /><label for="c-work" class="sq"><b>ChatGPT work account</b><span>Business, Enterprise, Edu or Healthcare</span></label></div>
          <section class="panel sq" id="p-work" aria-labelledby="h-work">
            <div><h3 id="h-work">Add Archie to a ChatGPT work account</h3><p class="plan">For Business, Enterprise, Edu and Healthcare workspaces.</p></div>
            <ol>
              <li><span>Download <b class="file">rotary-archie.zip</b>. Do not open or unzip it.</span></li>
              <li><span>Check that your workspace name shows at the bottom left, so Archie goes into your work account.</span></li>
              <li><span>Open <b>Plugins</b>, choose the <b>Skills</b> tab, then <b>Add</b>, then <b>Upload from your computer</b>, and pick <span class="file">rotary-archie.zip</span>.</span></li>
              <li><span>Start a new conversation in <b>Work</b> mode (the toggle at the top) and ask <q>What version of Archie are you?</q></span></li>
            </ol>
            <p class="aside">If Skills is missing, your workspace administrator may have turned skills off.</p>
            <div class="dl"><a class="btn fill sq" href={DOWNLOAD}><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-down"/></svg>Download rotary-archie.zip</a><small>Always the newest version.</small></div>
            <p class="more"><a href={u('get/chatgpt/')}>Full ChatGPT guide</a></p>
          </section>
          <div class="choice"><input type="radio" name="assistant" id="c-grok" value="grok" aria-controls="p-grok" /><label for="c-grok" class="sq"><b>Grok</b><span>SuperGrok or SuperGrok Heavy</span></label></div>
          <section class="panel sq" id="p-grok" aria-labelledby="h-grok">
            <div><h3 id="h-grok">Add Archie to Grok</h3><p class="plan">For SuperGrok and SuperGrok Heavy. The free tier cannot add skills.</p></div>
            <ol>
