              <li><span>At grok.com, open <b>Plugins</b> in the left sidebar, then the <b>Skills</b> tab.</span></li>
              <li><span>Choose <b>New Skill</b>, then <b>Upload skill file</b>, and drop <span class="file">rotary-archie.zip</span> on the box.</span></li>
              <li><span>Start a new conversation and ask <q>What version of Archie are you?</q> Grok may first ask for your birth year.</span></li>
