            <p class="more"><a href={u('get/grok/')}>Full Grok guide</a></p>
          </section>
          <div class="choice"><input type="radio" name="assistant" id="c-help" value="help" aria-controls="p-help" /><label for="c-help" class="sq"><b>ChatGPT Free</b><span>Skills are not available there</span></label></div>
          <section class="panel sq" id="p-help" aria-labelledby="h-help">
            <div><h3 id="h-help">If you use ChatGPT Free</h3><p class="plan">ChatGPT Free cannot add skills. Claude's free plan takes the same file, so that is the way forward.</p></div>
            <ol>
              <li><span>Go to claude.ai and sign in. A free account works.</span></li>
              <li><span>Download <b class="file">rotary-archie.zip</b>. Do not open or unzip it.</span></li>
              <li><span>Choose <a href="#get" data-pick="c-claude">Claude</a> in the list above and follow its steps.</span></li>
            </ol>
            <p class="aside">A ChatGPT Project is not a route on Free: a Free project holds five files, and Archie needs eight documents. On Go, Plus or higher, a Project works.</p>
            <div class="dl"><a class="btn fill sq" href={DOWNLOAD}><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-down"/></svg>Download rotary-archie.zip</a><small>Do not open or unzip it.</small></div>
            <p class="more"><a href={u('get/claude/')}>Full Claude guide</a><a href={u('get/no-assistant/')}>If Archie does not answer</a></p>
          </section>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
      </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="version" aria-labelledby="h-version">
      <div class="wrap version">
        <p class="fig"><b class="num">{release.version}</b><span>The current version, updated {updated}</span></p>
        <div class="copy">
          <h2 id="h-version">Ask Archie its version to confirm it loaded</h2>
          <p>In a new conversation, ask <q>What version of Archie are you?</q> Archie answers with its version and the date it was last updated. Compare them with the version here. If your assistant answers without Archie, call it by name: type <b>/</b> in the message box and choose Archie from the list. On ChatGPT Free, see <a href="#get" data-pick="c-help">ChatGPT Free</a> in the picker above.</p>
          <p class="links"><a href={u('get/test/')}>Test your setup</a><a href={u('get/update/')}>How updates arrive</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

